 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/eight-heads.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Eight Heads — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>You have mastered reverse cursed technique and learned the reversal of your technique. Life is precious. Unlike you, most people do not get do-overs. As an action for 10 CE, you target a creature within 60 ft and reinforce their mortality. Until they complete a long rest, they are unable to regain hit points, automatically fail death saves, and take additional necrotic damage equal to your CE modifier whenever they take necrotic damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Offering.</strong> At 11th level, when you would use Maximum: Sacrifice, you can instead spend 12 cursed energy. A creature of your choice within the barrier instead regains 10d4 hit points at the start of their turn.</p>",
   "chat": ""
  },
